SUMMARY:Azn Zine Fest
LOCATION:Fubonn Shopping Center — 2850 SE 82nd Ave\, Portland\, OR 97266
URL:https://aznzinefest.tumblr.com/
DESCRIPTION:who\n- all are welcome & free to attend! (masks provided\, required\, seen as an act of care <3)\n- over 100 azn zinesters (https://aznzinefest.tumblr.com/vendors) are coming to inspire you with their art and zines\\~\n- organized by local pdx azn folk: Envy Estacio\, Yoko O.K.\, A’misa Chiu\, Sarah Joy Calpo\, Julia Kim\, Natalie Soutonglang\, & SJ Anderson\n\nSpecial Thanks\n\nazn zine fest is honored and grateful to be one of 13 amazing projects that was selected to be a 2026 Precipice Fund grant recipient through PICA PDX (https://www.pica.org/precipice-fund) \\~ it’s such a surreal thing to be able to represent azn creatives in Portland thru this DIY project\, and for zines in contemporary art spaces! <3\n\nhttps://aznzinefest.tumblr.com/\n\nCategory: Zine Fest
CATEGORIES:Zine Fest
END:VEVENT
